WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.345 --> 00:00:01.470
Imma tell you something.

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:06.270
Every person in their life
has had a million-dollar idea.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.590
No doubt.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:09.370
No doubt.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.830
It's just, are you
going to take action?

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.400
You definitely do not need
to go to business school

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.840
to become an entrepreneur.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.900
I started Spanx as a
frustrated consumer.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.930
I had $5,000 set
aside in savings.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:26.560
I simply wanted to be able to
wear white pants to a party

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.390
and have nothing
show underneath it.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.250
The entire time, everyone
told me no and said,

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.560
this is not a great idea.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.130
But let me tell you one thing.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.340
That means you've come up
with something brand new.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.010
Take it as a compliment.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.630
This MasterClass
class is for anyone

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.755
out there who's in search
of an idea, has an idea

00:00:47.755 --> 00:00:49.130
and doesn't know
what to do next,

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:51.260
is wanting to start a
business, or has already

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.285
started a business.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.660
I guess, in some
way, I'm saying,

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.440
I think this class
is for everybody.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.300
Before I started
Spanx, I actually

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.460
was selling fax
machines door to door.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.500
I got kicked out of
building after building.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.620
And one day, I thought,
I'm in the wrong movie.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.230
Like call the producer,
call the director.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:09.550
This is not my life.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.480
What happened?

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.630
I can tell you the things that
I focused on very early on.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:17.447
Three things-- make it,
sell it, build awareness.

00:01:17.447 --> 00:01:19.780
People are looking for that,
I want to be a $100 million

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.155
company in the
first year and I'm

00:01:21.155 --> 00:01:23.230
going to raise as much
money as I possibly can.

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:25.870
And just check in
with yourself on that,

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.850
and be willing to start small.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:30.050
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:31.850
Why are you doing this?

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:32.650
What's the why?

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.180
And who are you in the world?

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:35.570
Share that part of the story.

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.720
I mean, the more vulnerable
you're willing to be,

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:40.720
the deeper the connection
will be with your consumers.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:43.480
I hope that you're tuning
in, and you're seeing me,

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.370
and I become the
example that you needed

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.280
to say, check, yes you can.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.100
I'm Sara Blakely, and
this is my MasterClass.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:54.150
[MUSIC PLAYING]

